#: ../../bayesml.metatree.rst:2
msgid "bayesml.metatree package"
msgstr "bayesml.metatree package"

#: ../../bayesml.metatree.rst:5
msgid "Module contents"
msgstr "モジュール内容"

#: bayesml.metatree:1 of
msgid "This module provides a Bayesian decision tree model with a prior distribution."
msgstr "このモジュールでは、ある種のベイズ決定木モデルとその事前分布を利用できます。"

#: bayesml.metatree:7 of
msgid "Stochastic Data Generative Model"
msgstr "確率的データ生成モデル"

#: bayesml.metatree:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}=[x_1, \\ldots, x_p, x_{p+1}, \\ldots , x_{p+q}]` : an explanatory variable. The "
"first :math:`p` variables are continuous. The other :math:`q` variables are categorical."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}=[x_1, \\ldots, x_p, x_{p+1}, \\ldots , x_{p+q}]`：説明変数です。最初の :math:`p` 個の"
"変数は連続変数です。残りの :math:`q` 個の変数はカテゴリ変数です。"

#: bayesml.metatree:10 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{Y}` : a space of an objective variable"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathcal{Y}` : 目的変数の空間"

#: bayesml.metatree:11 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`y \\in \\mathcal{Y}` : an objective variable"
msgstr ":math:`y \\in \\mathcal{Y}` : 目的変数"

#: bayesml.metatree:12 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`D_\\mathrm{max} \\in \\mathbb{N}` : the maximum depth of trees"
msgstr ":math:`D_\\mathrm{max} \\in \\mathbb{N}` : 木の最大深さ"

#: bayesml.metatree:13 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` : the perfect tree where all the inner nodes have the same number of child nodes and "
"all the leaf nodes have the same depth of :math:`D_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ""
":math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`：すべての内部ノードが同じ数の子ノードを持ち、すべての葉ノードが同じ深"
"さ :math:`D_\\mathrm{max}` を持つ完全木"

#: bayesml.metatree:14 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` : the set of all the nodes of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}`：:math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` のすべてのノードの集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:15 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` : a node of a tree"
msgstr ":math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` : 木のノード"

#: bayesml.metatree:16 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max} \\subset \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` : the set of all the inner nodes "
"of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ""
":math:`\\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max} \\subset \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}`：:math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` のすべての内"
"部ノードの集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:17 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\mathcal{L}_\\mathrm{max} \\subset \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` : the set of all the leaf nodes "
"of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ""
":math:`\\mathcal{L}_\\mathrm{max} \\subset \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}`：:math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` のすべての葉"
"ノードの集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:18 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{T}` : the set of all the pruned subtrees of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathcal{T}`：::math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` の部分木からなる集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:19 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`T \\in \\mathcal{T}` : a pruned subtree of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`"
msgstr ":math:`T \\in \\mathcal{T}`：:math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` の部分木"

#: bayesml.metatree:20 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{I}_T` : the set of all the inner nodes of :math:`T`"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathcal{I}_T`：:math:`T` のすべての内部ノードの集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:21 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{L}_T` : the set of all the leaf nodes of :math:`T`"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathcal{L}_T` : :math:`T` のすべての葉ノードの集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:22 of
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{k}=(k_s)_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max}}` : indices of the features assigned to "
"inner nodes, i.e., :math:`k_s \\in \\{1, 2,\\ldots,p+q\\}`. If :math:`k_s \\leq p`, the node :math:`s` has a "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{k}=(k_s)_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max}}` : 内部ノードに割り当てられた特徴量のイン"
"デックス、すなわち :math:`k_s \\in \\{1, 2,\\ldots,p+q\\}` です。もし :math:`k_s \\leq p` であれば、ノー"
"ド :math:`s` には閾値があります。"

#: bayesml.metatree:23 of
msgid ""
":math:`\\mathcal{K}=\\{ 1, 2, \\ldots , p+q \\}^{|\\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max}|}` : the set of "
"all :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}`"
msgstr ""
":math:`\\mathcal{K}=\\{ 1, 2, \\ldots , p+q \\}^{|\\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max}|}` : すべて"
"の :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` の集合"

#: bayesml.metatree:24 of
msgid ":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\theta}=(\\theta_s)_{s \\in \\mathcal{S}}` : parameters assigned to the nodes"
msgstr ":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\theta}=(\\theta_s)_{s \\in \\mathcal{S}}` : ノードに割り当てられたパラメータ"

#: bayesml.metatree:25 of
msgid ""
":math:`s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T}(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\in \\mathcal{L}_T` : a leaf node which :math:`\\boldsymbol{x}"
"` reaches under :math:`T` and :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}`"
msgstr ""
":math:`s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T}(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\in \\mathcal{L}_T`： :math:`T` かつ :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` "
"の下で :math:`\\boldsymbol{x}` が到達する葉ノード"

#: bayesml.metatree:27 of
msgid ""
"p(y | \\boldsymbol{x}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, T, \\boldsymbol{k})=p(y | \\theta_{s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T}"
"(\\boldsymbol{x})})\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(y | \\boldsymbol{x}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, T, \\boldsymbol{k})=p(y | \\theta_{s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T}"
"(\\boldsymbol{x})})\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:31 of
msgid "Prior Distribution"
msgstr "事前分布"

#: bayesml.metatree:33 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`g_s \\in [0,1]` : a hyperparameter assigned to each node :math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}`. "
"For any leaf node :math:`s` of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`, we assume :math:`g_s=0`."
msgstr ""
":math:`g_s \\in [0,1]`：各ノード  :math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` に割り当てられるハイパーパラメー"
"タ。 :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` の任意の葉ノード :math:`s` について、:math:`g_s=0` と仮定します。"

#: bayesml.metatree:35 of
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k}) &= \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{K}|} = \\left( \\frac{1}{p+q} \\right)^{|\\mathcal{I}"
"_\\mathrm{max}|}, \\\\\n"
"p(T) &= \\prod_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_T} g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathcal{L}_T} (1-g_{s'}).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k}) &= \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{K}|} = \\left( \\frac{1}{p+q} \\right)^{|\\mathcal{I}"
"_\\mathrm{max}|}, \\\\\n"
"p(T) &= \\prod_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_T} g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathcal{L}_T} (1-g_{s'}).\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:39 of
msgid ""
"The prior distribution of the parameter :math:`\\theta_s` is assumed to be a conjugate prior distribution "
"for :math:`p(y | \\theta_s)` and independent for each node."
msgstr ""
"パラメータ :math:`\\theta_s` の事前分布は、:math:`p(y | \\theta_s)` に対して共役事前分布であり、各ノードごと"
"に独立していると仮定します。"

#: bayesml.metatree:42 of
msgid "Posterior Distribution"
msgstr "事後分布"

#: bayesml.metatree:44 of
msgid "The posterior distribution is approximated as follows:"
msgstr "事後分布は次のように近似されます："

#: bayesml.metatree:46 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`n \\in \\mathbb{N}` : a sample size"
msgstr ":math:`n \\in \\mathbb{N}`: サンプルサイズ"

#: bayesml.metatree:47 of
msgid ":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}^n = \\{ \\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\ldots, \\boldsymbol{x}_n \\}`"
msgstr ":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}^n = \\{ \\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\ldots, \\boldsymbol{x}_n \\}`"

#: bayesml.metatree:48 of
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}` : the explanatory variables of the data points that pass "
"through :math:`s` under :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}`."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}`：:math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` の下で :math:`s` を通過するデータ点の説"
"明変数です。"

#: bayesml.metatree:49 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`y^n = \\{ y_1, y_2, \\ldots, y_n \\}`"
msgstr ":math:`y^n = \\{ y_1, y_2, \\ldots, y_n \\}`"

#: bayesml.metatree:50 of
msgid ""
":math:`y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}` : the objective variables of the data points that pass through :math:`s` "
"under :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}`."
msgstr ""
":math:`y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}`：:math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` の下で :math:`s` を通過するデータ点の目的変数です。"

#: bayesml.metatree:52 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"First, the posterior distribution :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k}, T, \\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, "
"y^n)` can be decomposed as follows:"
msgstr ""
"まず、事後分布 :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k}, T, \\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` は、次のように分"
"解できます："

#: bayesml.metatree:54 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k}, T, \\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}"
"^n, y^n) p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}) p(\\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}, T).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k}, T, \\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}"
"^n, y^n) p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}) p(\\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}, T).\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:57 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\theta}`, we can exactly calculate the posterior "
"distribution :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}, T)` because we "
"assumed the conjugate prior distribution."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\theta}` については、共役事前分布を仮定しているため、事後分"
"布 :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{\\theta} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}, T)` を正確に計算することができま"
"す。"

#: bayesml.metatree:59 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Also for :math:`T`, we can exactly calculate the posterior distribution :math:`p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})` by using the concept called a meta-tree.  The meta-tree is not a tree but a set of trees "
"where all the trees have the same feature assignment :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` to their inner nodes.  The "
"posterior distribution of the trees over the meta-tree defined by :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"また、:math:`T` についても、メタツリーと呼ばれる概念を用いることで、事後分布 :math:`p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, "
"y^n, \\boldsymbol{k})` を正確に計算することができます。メタツリーは単一のツリーではなく、すべてのツリーの内部"
"ノードに対して同じ特徴量の割り当て :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` が与えられているツリーの集合で"
"す。  :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` で定義されるメタツリー上の木々の事後分布は、以下の通りです："

#: bayesml.metatree:63 of
msgid ""
"p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}) = \\prod_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_T} g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}} \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathcal{L}_T} (1-g_{s'|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}}),\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(T | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}) = \\prod_{s \\in \\mathcal{I}_T} g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}} \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathcal{L}_T} (1-g_{s'|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}}),\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:66 of
msgid ""
"where :math:`g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} \\in [0,1]` can be calculated "
"from :math:`\\boldsymbol{x}^n`, :math:`y^n`, and :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ここで、:math:`g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} \\in [0,1]` は、:math:`\\boldsymbol{x}"
"^n`、:math:`y^n`、および :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` から次のように計算できます："

#: bayesml.metatree:68 of
msgid ""
"g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    \\frac{g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathrm{Ch}(s)}q(y_{s', \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s', "
"\\boldsymbol{k}}, s', \\boldsymbol{k})}{q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})}, & s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"    g_s, & \\mathrm{otherwise},\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    \\frac{g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathrm{Ch}(s)}q(y_{s', \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s', "
"\\boldsymbol{k}}, s', \\boldsymbol{k})}{q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})}, & s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"    g_s, & \\mathrm{otherwise},\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:75 of
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\mathrm{Ch}(s)` denotes the set of child nodes of :math:`s` on :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` "
"and :math:`q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k})` is defined "
"for any :math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` as follows."
msgstr ""
"ここで、:math:`\\mathrm{Ch}(s)` は、:math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` 上の :math:`s` の子ノードの集合を表"
"し、:math:`q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k})` は、任意"
"の :math:`s \\in \\mathcal{S}_\\mathrm{max}` に対して次のように定義されます。"

#: bayesml.metatree:77 of
msgid ""
"&q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    (1-g_s) f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) \\\\\n"
"    \\qquad {}+ g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathrm{Ch}(s)} q(y_{s', \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s', "
"\\boldsymbol{k}}, s', \\boldsymbol{k}), & s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"    f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}), & "
"\\mathrm{otherwise}.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"&q(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    (1-g_s) f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) \\\\\n"
"    \\qquad {}+ g_s \\prod_{s' \\in \\mathrm{Ch}(s)} q(y_{s', \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s', "
"\\boldsymbol{k}}, s', \\boldsymbol{k}), & s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"    f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}), & "
"\\mathrm{otherwise}.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:85 of
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k})` is "
"defined as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ここで、:math:`f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k})` は次のよ"
"うに定義されます："

#: bayesml.metatree:87 of
msgid ""
"f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) = \\int p(y_{s, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, \\theta_s) p(\\theta_s) \\mathrm{d}\\theta_s.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}) = \\int p(y_{s, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, \\theta_s) p(\\theta_s) \\mathrm{d}\\theta_s.\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:90 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}`, there are two algirithms to approximate the posterior "
"distribution :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)`: the meta-tree random forest (MTRF) and the "
"meta-tree Markov chain Monte Carlo (MTMCMC) method."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` について、事後分布 :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` を近似するアル"
"ゴリズムとして、メタツリー・ランダムフォレスト（MTRF）とメタツリー・マルコフ連鎖モンテカルロ（MTMCMC）法の2つ"
"があります。"

#: bayesml.metatree:93 of
msgid "Approximation by MTRF"
msgstr "MTRFによる近似"

#: bayesml.metatree:95 of
msgid ""
"In MTRF, we first construct a set of feature assignment vectors :math:`\\mathcal{K}' = \\{\\boldsymbol{k}_1, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}_2, \\ldots, \\boldsymbol{k}_B\\}` by using the usual (non-Bayesian) random forest algorithm. "
"Next, for :math:`\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}`, we approximate the posterior "
"distribution :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"MTRFでは、まず通常の（非ベイズ）ランダムフォレストアルゴリズムを用いて、特徴量割り当てベクトルの集"
"合 :math:`\\mathcal{K}' = \\{\\boldsymbol{k}_1, \\boldsymbol{k}_2, \\ldots, \\boldsymbol{k}_B\\}` を構築しま"
"す。 次に、:math:`\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}` について、事後分布 :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` を次のように近似します："

#: bayesml.metatree:98 of
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) \\approx \\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) "
"\\propto \\begin{cases}\n"
"    q(y_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}), & \\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}',\\\\\n"
"    0, & \\mathrm{otherwise}.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) \\approx \\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) "
"\\propto \\begin{cases}\n"
"    q(y_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}), & \\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}',\\\\\n"
"    0, & \\mathrm{otherwise}.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:104 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "where :math:`s_{\\lambda}` is the root node of :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}`."
msgstr "ここで、:math:`s_{\\lambda}` は :math:`T_\\mathrm{max}` の根ノードです。"

#: bayesml.metatree:106 bayesml.metatree:139 of
msgid "The predictive distribution is approximated as follows:"
msgstr "予測分布は次のように近似されます："

#: bayesml.metatree:108 of
msgid ""
"p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = \\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}'} "
"\\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}),\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = \\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}'} "
"\\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}),\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:111 of
msgid ""
"where :math:`q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k})` is "
"calculated in a similar manner to :math:`q(y_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}}, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k})`."
msgstr ""
"ここで、:math:`q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k})` "
"は、 :math:`q(y_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})` と同様の方法で計算されます。"

#: bayesml.metatree:113 of
msgid "The expectation of the predictive distribution is approximated as follows."
msgstr "予測分布の期待値は、次のように近似されます。"

#: bayesml.metatree:115 of
msgid ""
"\\mathbb{E}_{p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n] = \\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}'} \\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}],\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\mathbb{E}_{p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n] = \\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k} \\in \\mathcal{K}'} \\tilde{p}(\\boldsymbol{k} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}],\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:118 of
msgid "where the expectation for :math:`q` is recursively given as follows."
msgstr "ここで、:math:`q` の期待値は、次のように再帰的に与えられます。"

#: bayesml.metatree:120 of
msgid ""
"&\\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}] \\\\\n"
"&= \\begin{cases}\n"
"(1-g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}}) \\mathbb{E}_{f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},"
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}] \\\\\n"
"\\qquad + g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},"
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\mathrm{child}, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}] ,& s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbb{E}_{f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}],& (\\mathrm{otherwise}).\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"&\\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}] \\\\\n"
"&= \\begin{cases}\n"
"(1-g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}}) \\mathbb{E}_{f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},"
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, "
"\\boldsymbol{k}] \\\\\n"
"\\qquad + g_{s|\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}} \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},"
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\mathrm{child}, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}] ,& s \\in \\mathcal{I}_\\mathrm{max},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbb{E}_{f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})} [Y_{n+1} | "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}],& (\\mathrm{otherwise}).\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:128 of
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})` is calculated in a "
"similar manner to :math:`f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, "
"\\boldsymbol{k})` and :math:`s_\\mathrm{child}` is the child node of :math:`s` on the path from the root "
"node to the leaf node :math:`s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T_\\mathrm{max}}(\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1})`."
msgstr ""
"ここで、:math:`f(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s, \\boldsymbol{k})`  "
"は、  :math:`f(y_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}} | \\boldsymbol{x}_{s, \\boldsymbol{k}}, s, \\boldsymbol{k}` と同様の方"
"法で計算され、 :math:`s_\\mathrm{child}` は、根ノードから葉ノード  :math:`s_{\\boldsymbol{k},T_\\mathrm{max}}"
"(\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1})` へのパス上の  :math:`s`  の子ノードとなります。"

#: bayesml.metatree:131 of
msgid "Approximation by MTMCMC"
msgstr "MTMCMCによる近似"

#: bayesml.metatree:133 of
msgid ""
"In MTMCMC method, we generate a sample :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` from the posterior "
"distribution :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` by a MCMC method, and the posterior "
"distribution is approximated by the empirical distribution of this sample. Let :math:`\\{\\boldsymbol{k}"
"^{(t)}\\}_{t=1}^{t_\\mathrm{end}}` be the obtained sample."
msgstr ""
"MTMCMC法では、MCMC法を用いて事後分布 :math:`p(\\boldsymbol{k} | \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)` から標"
"本 :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` を生成し、この標本の経験分布によって事後分布を近似します。 得られた標本"
"を :math:`\\{\\boldsymbol{k}^{(t)}\\}_{t=1}^{t_\\mathrm{end}}` とします。"

#: bayesml.metatree:137 of
msgid "Predictive Distribution"
msgstr "予測分布"

#: bayesml.metatree:141 of
msgid ""
"p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = \\frac{1}{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\sum_{t=1}"
"^{t_\\mathrm{end}} q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}"
"^{(t)}).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n) = \\frac{1}{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\sum_{t=1}"
"^{t_\\mathrm{end}} q(y_{n+1}|\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}"
"^{(t)}).\n"
"\n"

#: bayesml.metatree:144 of
msgid "The expectation of the predictive distribution is approximated as follows:"
msgstr "予測分布の期待値は、次のように近似されます："

#: bayesml.metatree:146 of
msgid ""
"\\mathbb{E}_{p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n] = \\frac{1}{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\sum_{t=1}^{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|"
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}^{(t)})} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}"
"_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}^{(t)}].\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\mathbb{E}_{p(y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n)} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n] = \\frac{1}{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\sum_{t=1}^{t_\\mathrm{end}} \\mathbb{E}_{q(y_{n+1}|"
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{n+1},\\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, s_\\lambda, \\boldsymbol{k}^{(t)})} [Y_{n+1}| \\boldsymbol{x}"
"_{n+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}^n, y^n, \\boldsymbol{k}^{(t)}].\n"
"\n"

