msgid ""
"A vector of positive integers whose length is  ``c_dim_continuous+c_dim_categorical``.  The first "
"``c_dim_continuous`` elements represent  the maximum assignment numbers of continuous features  on a path. "
"The other ``c_dim_categorial`` elements  represent those of categorical features. If it  has a negative "
"element (e.g., -1), the corresponding  feature will be assigned any number of times.  By default [-1,...,-1]."
msgstr ""
"長さが ``c_dim_continuous+c_dim_categorical`` である正の整数のベクトルです。最初の ``c_dim_continuous`` 個の"
"要素は、パス上の連続型特徴の最大割り当て数を表します。 残りの ``c_dim_categorical`` 個の要素は、カテゴリ型特"
"徴量の最大割り当て数を表します。負の要素（例：-1）が含まれる場合、対応する特徴量は何度でも割り当てられます。"
"デフォルトでは [-1,...,-1] です。"

