msgid "**threshold_fix**"
msgstr "**threshold_fix**"

#: bayesml.metatree._metatree.GenModel.gen_params:12 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, thresholds for continuous features will be fixed, by default ``False``.  If ``feature_fix`` is "
"``False``, ``threshold_fix`` must be ``False``."
msgstr ""
"「True」の場合、連続型特徴量の閾値は固定されます。デフォルトは「False」です。「feature_fix」が「False」の場"
"合、「threshold_fix」は「False」でなければなりません。"

#: bayesml.metatree._metatree.GenModel.gen_params:15 of
msgid "**tree_fix**"
msgstr "**tree_fix**"

#: bayesml.metatree._metatree.GenModel.gen_params:16 of
